# Fragment of drivers/usb/host/Kconfig

config USB_APPLE_T2_VHCI
	tristate "Apple T2 virtual USB host controller"
	depends on APPLE_T2_BRIDGE
	help
	  The T2 chip of Intel Macs connects keyboard, trackpad, Touch Bar
	  and other internal devices through a virtual USB host controller.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called apple-t2-vhci-hcd.
